#showas:亵渎的獾
The AI has allied itself with dreadful Lovecraftian monsters from beyond space and time.

Can you survive that unholy alliance, along with several other unexpected foes? By your side are Elderlings to aid you.

On top of all that, Doomsday Mode is active, steadily destroying planets from the galaxy.

Played on a Classic map, with Hidden Galaxy. One AI, a Miskatonic at Intensity 7.


Requires the Dyson Sidekick mod